Keeps public/ in the repository so the Dockerfile's `COPY /app/public` always has a source.

It is currently empty: the Leaflet marker icons that used to live here were replaced by inline SVG
(see src/features/clients/SitesMap.tsx). Anything dropped in here is served from the site root — a
favicon, robots.txt — and is reachable without a session, because the middleware matcher excludes
static files.
